+## 2. What landed (all individually measured)
+
+| # | change | Δ.text |
+|---|---|---:|
+| 1 | P15 16-bit canonical compares (already counted last round) | −15 |
+| 2 | P16 const staging (`movl $imm|$sym,%B; movl %B,%C`, census==0 for %B) | −2/site (4 numeric sites fire today) |
